# Logic-layer kernels: parametric schemas proved with P,Q,R uninterpreted (FOUNDATION_TO_FOLZFC.md §4).
schema conjI [P(0), Q(0)]: (P -> (Q -> (P & Q)))
schema disjE [P(0), Q(0), R(0)]: ((P | Q) -> ((P -> R) -> ((Q -> R) -> R)))
schema spec  [P(1)]: ((forall x. P(x)) -> (forall y. P(y)))
claim demo: forall a. forall b. ((elem(a,b) & elem(b,a)) -> (elem(b,a) & elem(a,b)))
